        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions YRK01ACBAL, Modern Acrylic Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Modern Acrylic Handle is handmade in the USA by the master craftsmen at First Impressions from the finest clear acrylic available. The acrylic is manufactured with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading. The retro-modern design of this space age acrylic handle is really stunning; our pictures do not do them justice. The mounts are finished in brushed aluminum.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions YRK01ACBAL Modern Acrylic Handles:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Handle Material: Clear Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Finish: Brushed Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Door Material: Select fiberglass/wood, glass, or metal door.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>FII-YRK01009:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>YRK01018ACBAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>YRK01018ACBAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>YRK01024ACBAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This First Impressions acrylic pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Acrylic Handle",
                "description": "This Modern Acrylic Handle is handmade in the USA by the master craftsmen at First Impressions from the finest clear acrylic available. The acrylic is manufactured with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading. The retro-modern design of this space age acrylic handle is really stunning; our pictures do not do them justice. The mounts are finished in brushed aluminum.\r\n",
